RIM Variable Example
RIM Demonstrates SEP command for setting variables

ECKO Setting variables...
SEP name = Alice
SEP age = 25
SEP city = New York

ECKO
ECKO Name: %name%
ECKO Age: %age%
ECKO City: %city%

RIM Modify variables
SEP name = Bob
SEP message = Hello %name%, you are %age% years old!

ECKO
ECKO %message%

RIM Variables in expressions
SEP x = 10
SEP y = 20
ECKO x = %x%
ECKO y = %y%
